    "summary": "Spend 2 CP in the opposing player's [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase), right after an enemy unit shoots. Pick a **LEAGUES OF VOTANN INFANTRY** unit hit by any of those attacks, then pick one of these friendly units within 6\" of it:\n\n- a **KAPRICUS** or **SAGITAUR** unit\n- if you spend 2 [Yield Points](vsdata:ability/leagues-of-votann.prioritised-efficiency) on this use, a **HEKATON LAND FORTRESS** unit instead\n\nThe picked unit can shoot as though in your Shooting phase, but its models can target nothing except that enemy unit, which must be an eligible target.",
